{"NoMethodError in before_validation callback if EmbeddableHost is saved with nil host - the callback calls self.host.sub! without a presence check": 0.9181743264198303, "Null pointer dereference in destroy action - if a request is made with an id that does not exist, calling .destroy on nil raises NoMethodError": 0.8899197578430176, "Case-sensitivity mismatch in record_for_host causes valid hosts to be rejected - the query uses lower(host) but the parameter passed is not lowercased": 0.6856629848480225, "Inconsistent state on cancel - the cancel action fails to fully revert the component's state by not resetting the categoryId property after rollbackBuffer(), leaving categoryId with the new unsaved value": 0.6398305892944336, "Null pointer dereference - the embedding property is initialized to null and calling saveChanges, addHost, or deleteHost before embedding is populated will cause a TypeError": 0.33622294664382935, "Unused code - the saveChanges action in admin-embedding.js.es6 and the corresponding update action in embedding_controller.rb are implemented but never used by the UI": 0.1720811426639557, "Incorrect route nesting due to an absolute path - the path '/embedding' starts with a forward slash, creating the route at /embedding instead of the intended /customize/embedding": 0.20888495445251465, "Race condition from enabled buttons during save - the edit and delete buttons are not disabled when host.isSaving is true, allowing actions while a save operation is in-flight": 0.31830570101737976, "Incomplete string replacement causes incorrect API path generation - type.replace('_', '-') only replaces the first underscore, causing ADMIN_MODELS lookup to fail for types with multiple underscores": 0.607517421245575, "Null pointer dereference in data hydration - calling .map on a property value without verifying it is an array will cause TypeError if API provides null for a key ending in _ids": 0.8997968435287476, "Mass assignment vulnerability in the create action - the action calls save_host which directly assigns attributes from raw params hash, bypassing Strong Parameters": 0.6282790899276733, "Unbounded database query loads all records into memory - EmbeddableHost.all fetches the entire table on every request without pagination": 0.21070142090320587, "Unhandled TypeError when request.referer is nil - the Referer header is optional and passing nil to EmbeddableHost.host_allowed? will raise TypeError": 0.6106253266334534, "Inconsistent return type from record_for_host causes NoMethodError - the method returns false for invalid URIs but TopicEmbed calls .try on the result which is not defined for FalseClass": 0.3083430528640747, "Duplicate YAML key - the key 'embedding' is added under admin_js.admin scope but an identical key already exists at line 2552": 0.048940565437078476, "Unhandled nil access causes migration failure - accessing [0] on database query result without verifying rows exist will raise NoMethodError if embed_category or uncategorized_category_id settings are missing": 0.9456869959831238, "SQL injection vulnerability in data migration - the INSERT statement uses raw string interpolation for hostname which could contain single quotes breaking SQL syntax": 0.9216932654380798, "Incorrect file content swap - the fabricator for embeddable_host has been placed in category_fabricator.rb, overwriting original category fabricators": 0.9886132478713989, "Null pointer dereference in after_build callback - the :private_category fabricator will crash if invoked without a transient :group parameter": 0.12014363706111908, "The /fruits/:id endpoint handler is hardcoded to return the first fruit, ignoring the id parameter from the URL": 0.5125296115875244, "Brittle test relies on implicit findAll result ordering - test makes assertions on records at specific indices without guaranteed order": 0.23296576738357544, "Raw params access without whitelisting in save_host exposes the application to mass assignment vulnerabilities": 0.7042562961578369, "Dead update action discards all submitted changes - the method body is identical to show, re-rendering current state without reading params or persisting anything": 0.8009634017944336}